{"name":"Tailwind","hex":"#f5e8cf","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tailwind","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A wind that blows in the same direction as the course taken by an aircraft, sailing ship, bird, etc.; a following wind.","A force that accelerates progress."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Of a wind, to blow on a windmill or wind turbine in such a way that wind pressure is exerted on the wrong side of the sail or turbine assembly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tailwind"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tailwind (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Tailwind is the debut studio album of Australian singer songwriter Harmony James."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/9e/Cover_to_Tailwind_CD.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tailwind_(album)","wikidata":"Q16952897"},{"title":"Headwind and tailwind","blocks":[{"text":"A headwind is a wind that blows against the direction of travel of an object, while a tailwind blows in the direction of travel. A headwind decreases the object's speed and increases the time required to reach its destination, while a tailwind has the opposite effect."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Headwind_and_tailwind","wikidata":"Q127603317"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Effect_of_wind_on_takeoff_and_landing.png/500px-Effect_of_wind_on_takeoff_and_landing.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Effect_of_wind_on_takeoff_and_landing.png/1280px-Effect_of_wind_on_takeoff_and_landing.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Effect_of_wind_on_takeoff_and_landing.png/500px-Effect_of_wind_on_takeoff_and_landing.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The general effect of wind by the percent change in takeoff or landing distance as a function of the ratio of wind velocity to takeoff or landing speed.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AEffect_of_wind_on_takeoff_and_landing.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Wind_indicator_in_long_jump_area_at_TNT_-_Fortuna_Meeting_in_Kladno_16June2010_118.jpg/500px-Wind_indicator_in_long_jump_area_at_TNT_-_Fortuna_Meeting_in_Kladno_16June2010_118.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Wind_indicator_in_long_jump_area_at_TNT_-_Fortuna_Meeting_in_Kladno_16June2010_118.jpg/1280px-Wind_indicator_in_long_jump_area_at_TNT_-_Fortuna_Meeting_in_Kladno_16June2010_118.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Wind_indicator_in_long_jump_area_at_TNT_-_Fortuna_Meeting_in_Kladno_16June2010_118.jpg/500px-Wind_indicator_in_long_jump_area_at_TNT_-_Fortuna_Meeting_in_Kladno_16June2010_118.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Wind indicator at a long jump runway","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWind_indicator_in_long_jump_area_at_TNT_-_Fortuna_Meeting_in_Kladno_16June2010_118.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}